---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Text from "@/components/fundations/elements/Text.astro";
import Button from "@/components/fundations/elements/Button.astro";
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";

const title = "The Tender Path℠ | Perimenopause Support for Executive Women";

const description = "Normal blood tests but still not yourself? The Tender Path℠ helps executive women navigate perimenopause without workplace disclosure.";

const pageJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  name: title,
  description,
  url: "https://www.lozenadvisory.com/normal-blood-tests-feel-off",
  publisher: {
    "@type": "Organization",
    name: "Lozen Advisory",
    url: "https://www.lozenadvisory.com",
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <script
    type="application/ld+json"
    set:html={JSON.stringify(pageJsonLd)}
  ></script>

  <section class="overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-t from-base-200 to-white">
    <Wrapper variant="standard" class="py-24 lg:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <Text
          tag="span"
          variant="textSM"
          class="pl-4 font-medium uppercase border-l text-base-900 font-display border-accent-500"
        >
          The Tender Path℠
        </Text>

        <Text
          tag="h1"
          variant="displayXL"
          class="mt-8 uppercase font-display text-base-900"
        >
          Your Blood Tests Are Normal. But You Don’t Feel Like Yourself.
        </Text>

        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textLG"
          class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base-600 text-balance"
        >
          Something has shifted. You feel it.
        </Text>

        <div class="mt-10">
          <Button
            isLink
            href="/booking"
            variant="default"
            size="sm"
            class="w-fit"
          >
            Begin with the MAPS Blueprint℠
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Wrapper>
  </section>

  <section>
    <Wrapper variant="narrow" class="py-12 lg:py-20">
      <article class="space-y-14">
        <section class="space-y-5">
          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            And you cannot explain it to anyone.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            Not the fog that sits behind your eyes. Not the words that vanish mid-sentence. Not the sporadic night sweats. Not the mood swings. Not the woman in the mirror who looks like you but does not quite feel like you.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            You are not burning out. You are not falling apart. You have not lost your edge.
          </Text>

          <Text
            tag="p"
            variant="textLG"
            class="font-display text-base-900"
          >
            Your body has changed the rules without telling you.
          </Text>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-5">
          <Text
            tag="h2"
            variant="displaySM"
            class="font-display uppercase text-base-900"
          >
            What you are experiencing has a name. And it is not burnout.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            Perimenopause does not announce itself. It arrives quietly in your 40s, sometimes earlier, and it can run for a decade. It rewires your sleep, your focus, your energy, your confidence.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            Your doctor ran the tests. Everything came back normal. But you know something is different.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            You have always known your own body. And right now your body feels like someone else’s.
          </Text>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-5">
          <Text
            tag="h2"
            variant="displaySM"
            class="font-display uppercase text-base-900"
          >
            Perimenopause does not wait for a convenient moment.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            Most women adjust. Compensate. Work harder to produce the same result and tell no one why. And somewhere in the middle of all that keeping it together, you lose the thread back to yourself.
          </Text>

          <Text
            tag="p"
            variant="textLG"
            class="font-display text-base-900"
          >
            You are not lost. You are in transition.
          </Text>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-3xl bg-base-950 p-6 shadow-2xl outline-4 outline-base-500/10 sm:p-8">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <Text
              tag="blockquote"
              variant="textLG"
              class="font-display text-white"
            >
              “All of it can feel very isolating and you can feel like less of a woman.”
            </Text>

            <Text
              tag="blockquote"
              variant="textLG"
              class="font-display text-white"
            >
              “It is really bizarre. It is really frying my brain.”
            </Text>

            <Text
              tag="blockquote"
              variant="textLG"
              class="font-display text-white"
            >
              “How could I figure this out when no one was talking? It’s oddly like an unwritten code of silence.”
            </Text>

            <Text
              tag="blockquote"
              variant="textLG"
              class="font-display text-white"
            >
              “We suffer sexism and ageism. When we get to this time of life, we’re expected to white-knuckle it and bow out gracefully.”
            </Text>
          </div>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="mt-8 text-base-200">
            Other women are navigating this right now. You are not the only one carrying it quietly.
          </Text>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-5">
          <Text
            tag="h2"
            variant="displaySM"
            class="font-display uppercase text-base-900"
          >
            There is a way through.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            You can get back to yourself.
          </Text>

          <Text
            tag="p"
            variant="textLG"
            class="font-display text-base-900"
          >
            The Tender Path℠ was built for you.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            Clarity, so you stop guessing and start understanding yourself again.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            Softness, because pushing through got you here and it is not what gets you forward.
          </Text>

          <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-700">
            And ease. Real, practical ease. So the you on the other side doesn’t survive. She thrives.
          </Text>

          <Text
            tag="p"
            variant="textLG"
            class="font-display text-base-900"
          >
            The woman on the other side of this is not a lesser version of you. She is the best version of you.
          </Text>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-3xl border border-base-200 bg-base-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <Text
            tag="blockquote"
            variant="displayXS"
            class="font-display text-base-900"
          >
            “I built The Tender Path℠ because my daughter needed it and nothing existed for her. Now it exists for you.”
          </Text>

          <Text
            tag="p"
            variant="textSM"
            class="mt-5 font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-base-500"
          >
            Akilah E. Kamaria
          </Text>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-3xl bg-base-950 p-6 shadow-2xl outline-4 outline-base-500/10 sm:p-8">
          <Text
            tag="h2"
            variant="displaySM"
            class="font-display uppercase text-white"
          >
            One private conversation.
          </Text>

          <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
            <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-200">
              You tell us where you are. We tell you if we can help.
            </Text>

            <Text tag="p" variant="textBase" class="text-base-200">
              Most women begin with the MAPS Blueprint℠, a 90-minute private session.
            </Text>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <Button
              isLink
              href="/booking"
              variant="accent"
              size="sm"
              class="w-fit"
            >
              Begin with the MAPS Blueprint℠
            </Button>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </Wrapper>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
